Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:34:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-85: property grid categories, Arrange by Category
 by default, like WPF (0.85.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WPF (XAML Designer > Properties window): the properties are grouped by
category (Common / Layout / Appearance / Text ...), and "Arrange by" at the top
switches Category / Name for the whole grid; Category is the default. The
editable "外觀與版面" section was one flat table and the sort only applied to the
DFM properties (default by name). Now the editable rows are grouped into
一般 / 版面 / 外觀 / 文字 / 其他; Arrange by = 依類別 (default) / 依名稱 (A-Z, no
groups) / DFM 順序, applied to both sections. WPF_DIFF_LOG.md: 0.85 row and the
next open items (7 Pointer, 8 Ctrl+drag copy, 9 collapsible categories, 10
property descriptions).

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 159, smoke 169, panels, real VS Code 149): panels
(by category by default, Layout starts with Left; by name = A-Z without group
rows).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
